<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MyBank - Bank Management System</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f7fb;
            color: #222;
        }

        .navbar {
            background: #123c69;
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 25px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .navbar a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 15px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        .hero {
            background: white;
            padding: 45px 25px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            color: #123c69;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #666;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 22px;
            margin: 5px;
            background: #123c69;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .green {
            background: #198754;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #123c69;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            color: #777;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="navbar">
        <div class="logo">🏦 MyBank</div>
        <div>
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/search">Search</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="hero">
            <h1>🏦 Bank Management System</h1>
            <p>Python Based Bank Management System</p>

            <a class="btn" href="/login">🔐 Login</a>
            <a class="btn green" href="/create">➕ Create Account</a>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">

            <div class="card">
                <h3>💰 Deposit</h3>
                <p>Deposit money into your account.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>💸 Withdraw</h3>
                <p>Withdraw money from your account.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>📜 Transactions</h3>
                <p>View your transaction history.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>💾 File Handling</h3>
                <p>Bank data is handled using Python.</p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        Bank Management System | Class 12 Python Project
    </div>

</body>
</html>
